1
00:00:08,851 --> 00:00:13,392
Medoro mein medicines ka poora master Stock
screen par hai.

2
00:00:13,432 --> 00:00:18,828
Har medicine ke saath uska salt, schedule, kul
stock, agli expiry, MRP

3
00:00:18,868 --> 00:00:21,079
aur rack location dikhta hai.

4
00:00:21,838 --> 00:00:26,088
Medicine ko brand name, salt ya barcode se khoj
sakte hain.

5
00:00:26,128 --> 00:00:31,687
Jaise salt mein Paracetamol likhne par us salt
ki saari brands aa jaati hain.

6
00:00:32,430 --> 00:00:34,936
Ab nayi medicine jodte hain.

7
00:00:34,976 --> 00:00:37,847
'Add medicine' par click kijiye.

8
00:00:37,887 --> 00:00:44,940
Naam, salt, MRP, GST rate, pack size, loose
unit, reorder level, rack, barcode

9
00:00:44,980 --> 00:00:48,214
aur schedule, sab yahin bharte hain.

10
00:00:48,967 --> 00:00:53,289
MRP paintaalees rupaye prati strip, GST paanch
pratishat.

11
00:00:53,329 --> 00:00:57,422
Ek strip mein das tablets, aur loose bikri ki
anumati,

12
00:00:57,462 --> 00:01:01,554
taaki zaroorat padne par ek-do tablet bhi bech
sakein.

13
00:01:02,319 --> 00:01:07,883
Reorder level pandrah strips, rack A3, aur pack
par chhapa barcode.

14
00:01:07,923 --> 00:01:13,487
Yeh medicine Schedule H mein nahi hai, isliye
schedule None rahega.

15
00:01:13,527 --> 00:01:14,742
Ab Save kijiye.

16
00:01:15,518 --> 00:01:17,723
Nayi medicine list mein aa gayi.

17
00:01:17,763 --> 00:01:23,686
Abhi iska stock shoonya hai; batch aur expiry ke
saath stock purchase bill se aayega,

18
00:01:23,726 --> 00:01:26,492
jo hum Purchase wale part mein dekhenge.

19
00:01:27,235 --> 00:01:31,404
Kisi medicine ko edit karne ke liye pencil icon
dabaaiye.

20
00:01:31,444 --> 00:01:36,943
Maan lijiye Paracip 650 ki rack badalni hai aur
reorder level badhaana hai.

21
00:01:37,688 --> 00:01:41,392
Save karte hi badlaav har counter par pahunch
jaata hai.

22
00:01:41,432 --> 00:01:43,866
Aur agar koi medicine ab nahi bechni,

23
00:01:43,906 --> 00:01:49,951
to use delete karne ki bajaay 'In use' ka tick
hata dijiye; woh billing se chhip jaati hai,

24
00:01:49,991 --> 00:01:52,492
par uska purana record bana rehta hai.

25
00:01:53,262 --> 00:01:59,350
Batch wale icon se har batch ki expiry, bacha
stock aur status dikhta hai.

26
00:01:59,390 --> 00:02:04,070
HSN code, GST aur MRP har bill par apne-aap
chhapte hain.
